"IP addresses listed here are banned from your site. Banned addresses "
"are completely forbidden from accessing the site and instead see a "
"brief message explaining the situation."
msgstr ""
"ഇവിടെ "
"പട്ടികപ്പെടുത്തിയിരിക്കുന്ന "
