msgstr "`space-between` തമ്മിലുള്ള ഇടവ്"

msgid "Space around (space-around)"
msgstr ""
"(space-around) ന്റെ ചുറ്റുമുള്ള "
"ഇടവ്"

msgid "Terms display"
